---
import PreviewLayout from '../../layouts/PreviewLayout.astro';
import RelatedPosts from '../../components/RelatedPosts.astro';

const title = "Best Poke in Hilo: A Local's Guide to Fresh Fish | Island Goodes";
const description = "Discover where locals go for the freshest poke bowls in Hilo, Hawaii. From historic fish markets to hidden gems, find the best raw fish on the Big Island.";
const publishDate = "2025-12-15";

const relatedPosts = [
  { slug: "hilo-farmers-market", title: "Hilo Farmers Market Guide", image: "/images/blog/farmers-market.webp", category: "Food" },
  { slug: "downtown-hilo-guide", title: "A Local's Guide to Downtown Hilo", image: "/images/blog/hilo-town.webp", category: "Guide" },
  { slug: "uncle-roberts-night-market", title: "Uncle Robert's Night Market", image: "/images/blog/night-market.webp", category: "Food" }
];
---

<PreviewLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="blog-post">
    <header class="post-header">
      <div class="post-header-bg">
        <img src="/images/blog/poke-bowl.webp" alt="Fresh poke bowl with fish and vegetables" />
      </div>
      <div class="post-header-overlay"></div>
      <div class="post-header-content">
        <nav class="breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/blog">Blog</a> / Best Poke in Hilo
        </nav>
        <span class="post-category">Food & Dining</span>
        <h1>Best Poke in Hilo: A Local's Guide</h1>
        <div class="post-meta">
          <time datetime={publishDate}>December 15, 2025</time>
          <span class="read-time">6 min read</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <p class="lead">
          Poke (pronounced POH-keh) isn't just food in Hawaii—it's a way of life. And nowhere
          is it fresher than in Hilo, where fishing boats unload their catch just steps from
          where you'll eat it. Here's where locals go for the best poke on the Big Island.
        </p>

        <h2>What Makes Great Poke?</h2>
        <p>
          Great poke starts with fresh fish—usually ahi (yellowfin tuna)—cut into bite-sized
          cubes and marinated in soy sauce, sesame oil, green onions, and various seasonings.
          In Hilo, "fresh" means the fish was swimming this morning. That's the standard here.
        </p>

        <div class="tip-box">
          <strong>Poke Pronunciation:</strong> It's "POH-keh" (two syllables), not "poh-KAY."
          Saying it correctly will earn you respect from locals!
        </div>

        <h2>Top Poke Spots in Hilo</h2>

        <div class="spot-card featured">
          <span class="spot-badge">Editor's Pick</span>
          <h3>Suisan Fish Market</h3>
          <p class="spot-location">93 Lihiwai St, Hilo (on Hilo Bay)</p>
          <p>
            This is the real deal. Suisan has been serving Hilo since 1907, and their poke
            counter is legendary. You're literally buying fish at a working fish market—watch
            the boats unload while you eat. The variety is unmatched: classic shoyu ahi, spicy
            ahi, tako (octopus), salmon, and seasonal specials.
          </p>
          <div class="spot-tips">
            <strong>Pro Tips:</strong>
            <ul>
              <li>Get there early—best options sell out by noon</li>
              <li>Try the limu (seaweed) poke for authentic Hawaiian style</li>
              <li>Grab a plate lunch combo to make it a full meal</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spot-card">
          <h3>Poke Market</h3>
          <p class="spot-location">Downtown Hilo</p>
          <p>
            A gourmet hole-in-the-wall that's elevated poke to an art form. Their All-Star
            Bowl combines spicy ahi with yuzu salmon and all the fixings. It's window
            service only with just two sidewalk tables, but the quality is worth the
            informal setting.
          </p>
          <div class="spot-tips">
            <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Come hungry—their portions are generous.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spot-card">
          <h3>Poke To Your Taste</h3>
          <p class="spot-location">Hilo</p>
          <p>
            The local's secret for traditional Hawaiian-style poke. They open at 5:30am on
            weekdays (yes, really!) to serve the early fishing crowd. The poke here is
            prepared in the traditional way—simple, fresh, and perfect.
          </p>
          <div class="spot-tips">
            <strong>Warning:</strong> Often sold out by noon. Closed on weekends.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spot-card">
          <h3>KTA Super Stores</h3>
          <p class="spot-location">Multiple locations</p>
          <p>
            Don't sleep on supermarket poke! KTA is a local grocery chain, and their poke
            counter is surprisingly excellent. Many longtime Hilo residents swear it's their
            go-to for everyday poke. It's also the most affordable option.
          </p>
          <div class="spot-tips">
            <strong>Best For:</strong> Budget-friendly, grab-and-go poke for beach picnics.
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Poke at the Farmers Market</h2>
        <p>
          The Hilo Farmers Market (Wednesday and Saturday mornings) has several vendors
          selling fresh poke bowls. It's a great way to combine your market browsing with
          lunch. Look for the lines—that's where the good stuff is.
        </p>

        <h2>Poke Etiquette</h2>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Point and ask to taste before buying—most places will let you sample</li>
          <li>Start with classic shoyu ahi if you're new to poke</li>
          <li>Ask what's fresh today—recommendations vary by catch</li>
          <li>Eat it within a few hours for best quality</li>
          <li>Pair with rice for a complete meal, or eat it straight from the container</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Poke Styles to Try</h2>
        <div class="styles-grid">
          <div class="style-card">
            <h4>Shoyu Ahi</h4>
            <p>The classic: soy sauce, sesame oil, green onions. Start here.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="style-card">
            <h4>Spicy Ahi</h4>
            <p>Mayo-based with sriracha or chili. Creamy and addictive.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="style-card">
            <h4>Limu Poke</h4>
            <p>Traditional Hawaiian style with seaweed. Authentic flavor.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="style-card">
            <h4>Tako Poke</h4>
            <p>Octopus! Chewy, flavorful, and very local.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-box">
          <h3>Stay Near Hilo's Best Poke</h3>
          <p>
            Island Goodes is just minutes from all these poke spots. Stock up on fresh
            poke and enjoy it on your private lanai with an ocean view.
          </p>
          <a href="/book" class="btn btn-primary">Book Your Stay</a>
        </div>

        <RelatedPosts posts={relatedPosts} />
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</PreviewLayout>

<style>
  .post-header { position: relative; min-height: 50vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; color: #fff; padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem; }
  .post-header-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -2; }
  .post-header-bg img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .post-header-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.3) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.7) 100%); }
  .post-header-content { max-width: 800px; }
  .post-category { display: inline-block; background: var(--color-secondary); color: #1a1a1a; padding: 0.375rem 1rem; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .post-header h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .post-meta { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; justify-content: center; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 0.9375rem; }

  .post-content { padding: var(--section-padding) 0; }
  .container.narrow { max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-text-light); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; }

  .post-content h2 { color: var(--color-text); font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; }
  .post-content p { color: var(--color-text-light); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

  .tip-box { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-bg-alt) 0%, rgba(27, 107, 90, 0.1) 100%); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin: 2rem 0; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); }
  .tip-box strong { color: var(--color-primary); }

  .spot-card { background: #fff; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); position: relative; }
  .spot-card.featured { border: 2px solid var(--color-secondary); }
  .spot-badge { position: absolute; top: -0.75rem; right: 1.5rem; background: var(--color-secondary); color: #1a1a1a; padding: 0.375rem 1rem; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .spot-card h3 { color: var(--color-text); font-size: 1.375rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .spot-location { color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem !important; }
  .spot-card > p:not(.spot-location) { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .spot-tips { background: var(--color-bg-alt); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .spot-tips strong { color: var(--color-text); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .spot-tips ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
  .spot-tips li { padding: 0.25rem 0; padding-left: 1rem; position: relative; color: var(--color-text-light); }
  .spot-tips li::before { content: "→"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--color-secondary); }

  .checklist { list-style: none; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .checklist li { padding: 0.5rem 0; padding-left: 1.75rem; position: relative; color: var(--color-text-light); }
  .checklist li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; }

  .styles-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .style-card { background: var(--color-bg-alt); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 12px; }
  .style-card h4 { color: var(--color-text); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; }
  .style-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-light); }

  .cta-box { background: var(--gradient-primary); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 16px; text-align: center; color: #fff; margin-top: 3rem; }
  .cta-box h3 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .cta-box p { opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .styles-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
